{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1398673-i-ve-been-working-on-a-cosplay-of-ma-ha-suchi-for-awhile-now-the-head-is-done","id":1398673,"title":"I've been working on a cosplay of Ma-Ha-Suchi for awhile now...the head is done!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-24T18:06:39-07:00","id":1398673,"title":"I've been working on a cosplay of Ma-Ha-Suchi for awhile now...the head is done!","content":"Well...mostly done. I need to drybrush some paint to give a bit more dimension to the facial expression, but at the moment I'm taking a break from all of it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/m1HiI0n1iD8\" data-code=\"m1HiI0n1iD8\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/m1HiI0n1iD8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> The basic rundown is that this is a resin head base with a bit of foam built up for the cheeks, and horn &quot;protrusions&quot;. The horns are also resin, but with a foam core to keep the weight down (it was very necessary given how heavy this thing got anyway...), and they're actually bolted through the base so that they don't go flying off and killing anyone.<br /> <br /> The upper and lower teeth/jaws are also resin, with squishy silicone tongue and nose. The eyes are hand-painted.<br /> <br /> The resin base is actually two pieces, with a metal V-shaped hinge connecting them. The hinge is supported with a stainless steel wire spring and heavy-duty elastic (the lower teeth/jaw is so heavy that it'd just hang open without doubling up like that). Even though I'm mostly opening and closing my mouth pretty big here, the jaw is capable of smaller motions - it's stupid sensitive.<br /> <br /> The caste mark is a NeoPixel Ring, and its run off of a super tiny, almost thumbnail-sized microcontroller that's set into the top of the resin base, under the fur. It's programmed to &quot;breathe&quot; in intensity, between pale blue and white light. All of the wiring is run through the inside of the mask, protected against corrosion with silicone caulking before the inside face supports (foam and fleece) were installed<br /> <br /> Next up I plan to do the clawed hands, then move onto the body once that's done - but right now I need a breather.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":17}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/41-silverwinglie","name":"silverwinglie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar41_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-24T18:46:08-07:00","id":1398681,"title":"","content":"Nnnneat.<br /> <br /> Actually, more than that. Quite impressive.<br /> <br /> I have a question: do you (can you?) intend to build a body suit with something like padded shoulders to be a bit proportional to the width of the head, or is that an unnecessary detail?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-24T18:52:02-07:00","id":1398683,"title":"","content":"Sweet Sun, this is amazing! The articulated mouth is super cool, and the caste mark is a great touch! Everyone should see how cool this is <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>What do we want? 3rd Edition Sidereals!<br /> When do we want it? In accordance with the dictates of Fate!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/867-jimborg","name":"Jimborg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-24T18:53:10-07:00","id":1398685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1398673-i-ve-been-working-on-a-cosplay-of-ma-ha-suchi-for-awhile-now-the-head-is-done?p=1398681#post1398681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nnnneat.<br /> <br /> Actually, more than that. Quite impressive.<br /> <br /> I have a question: do you (can you?) intend to build a body suit with something like padded shoulders to be a bit proportional to the width of the head, or is that an unnecessary detail?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes! I'm actually planning to sculpt basically the entire body in foam (since Ma-Ha is...pretty ripped) and then do the fur over top of that.<br /> <br /> I also have a pair of stilts that I assembled to give some extra height and the correct leg shape, but those are damned hard to walk in and will only be for photos/short clips.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/41-silverwinglie","name":"silverwinglie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar41_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-25T03:04:03-07:00","id":1398745,"title":"","content":"Nice! The caste mark is a very nice touch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-25T03:22:04-07:00","id":1398746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>silverwinglie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1398673-i-ve-been-working-on-a-cosplay-of-ma-ha-suchi-for-awhile-now-the-head-is-done?p=1398685#post1398685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes! I'm actually planning to sculpt basically the entire body in foam (since Ma-Ha is...pretty ripped) and then do the fur over top of that.<br /> <br /> I also have a pair of stilts that I assembled to give some extra height and the correct leg shape, but those are damned hard to walk in and will only be for photos/short clips.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's this Irish show that has a really great read on the word &quot;fantastic&quot; that I've always grieved for never being able to convey through text.<br /> <br /> I thought that I finally found a video clip of it, but it turns out that the skit cuts out seconds before the line comes up.<br /> <br /> Ah well. I wish you all the best.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-25T17:53:51-07:00","id":1398905,"title":"","content":"Thanks for that, it's definitely a situation where, believe it or not, the easy part is over. Engineering a full body suit is a little daunting - I've done it before, but not to this degree.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/41-silverwinglie","name":"silverwinglie",